### Role-aware token mapping

When choosing a token, **the role of the node decides which namespace** to draw from — never just the hex value:

| Node type | Property | Token namespace |
|---|---|---|
| Text (Poppins / Chivo Mono) | fill | `text/*` |
| Text (Font Awesome icon) | fill | `icon/*` |
| Frame / Rectangle | fill | `bg/*` |
| Frame / Rectangle | stroke | `border/*` |
| Frame | radius | `border/border-radius-*` |
| Frame | padding / gap | `spacing/spacing-*` |
| Text | fontSize | `size/font-size-*` |
| Text | lineHeight | `line-height/line-height-*` |
| Text (non-icon) | fontFamily | `family/title` (bold ≥ 16px) or `family/body` |
| Text (non-icon) | fontStyle | `weight/Regular` `Medium` `SemiBold` `Bold` |

