### Anti-patterns (causes "connected but wrong")

❌ Import Button → leave default → only bind wrapper colors → declare done.  
✅ Import Button → `setProperties` to match design → bind wrappers → screenshot diff.

❌ Import Modal at default size → empty or wrong content → declare done.  
✅ Pick correct Modal variant → set title/footer props → fill **content slot** with DS field/button instances.

❌ User asks to fix Modal size/layout → **delete** Modal instance → rebuild with `createFrame`.  
✅ Keep the Modal instance → adjust `setProperties` / inner auto-layout / nested instances.

