## After every write — bind every property (MANDATORY)

Importing DS instances + correct variants is **only the first half of the job**. Every custom wrapper frame, card, KPI cell, kanban column, sidebar surface, divider, icon disc, and individual text node you create around those instances must also have its colours, paddings, gaps, radii, and fonts **bound to Phenom DS variables**. If you finish a `use_figma` write without doing this, the file is half-built and you must continue.

### Binding API cheat sheet

```js
// 1. Import a Phenom variable by key (or resolve by name → key first)
const v = await figma.variables.importVariableByKeyAsync(KEY);

// 2a. Color (paint) — fills, strokes, text fills
//     setBoundVariableForPaint returns a NEW paint object — capture & reassign.
const cloned = node.fills.map(p => ({ ...p }));
cloned[0] = figma.variables.setBoundVariableForPaint(cloned[0], 'color', v);
node.fills = cloned;     // re-assign whole array; do NOT mutate in place

// 2b. Numeric — radius, padding, gap, fontSize, lineHeight
node.setBoundVariable('topLeftRadius',     radiusVar);
node.setBoundVariable('topRightRadius',    radiusVar);
node.setBoundVariable('bottomLeftRadius',  radiusVar);
node.setBoundVariable('bottomRightRadius', radiusVar);
node.setBoundVariable('paddingLeft',  spacingVar);
node.setBoundVariable('paddingRight', spacingVar);
node.setBoundVariable('paddingTop',   spacingVar);
node.setBoundVariable('paddingBottom',spacingVar);
node.setBoundVariable('itemSpacing',  gapVar);
textNode.setBoundVariable('fontSize',   sizeVar);
textNode.setBoundVariable('lineHeight', lhVar);
textNode.setBoundVariable('fontFamily', familyVar);
textNode.setBoundVariable('fontStyle',  weightVar);
```

### Reusable binding-sweep snippet

Run this **after** importing all DS instances and before declaring a write done. It walks every custom (non-instance) node on the current page and binds every fill, stroke, radius, padding, gap, fontSize, lineHeight, fontFamily, and fontStyle to the closest Phenom token.

```js
const REQUIRED_FONTS = [
  { family: 'Poppins', style: 'Regular' }, { family: 'Poppins', style: 'Medium' },
  { family: 'Poppins', style: 'SemiBold' }, { family: 'Poppins', style: 'Bold' },
  { family: 'Chivo Mono', style: 'Regular' },
  { family: 'Font Awesome 6 Free', style: 'Regular' },
  { family: 'Font Awesome 6 Free', style: 'Solid' },
  { family: 'Font Awesome 6 Brands', style: 'Regular' }
];
await Promise.all(REQUIRED_FONTS.map(f => figma.loadFontAsync(f)));

// Build a name → variable cache for every Phenom V2 variable
const phenom = (await figma.teamLibrary.getAvailableLibraryVariableCollectionsAsync())
  .filter(c => c.libraryName.includes('Phenom Design System V2'));
const nameToKey = {};
for (const c of phenom) {
  for (const v of await figma.teamLibrary.getVariablesInLibraryCollectionAsync(c.key))
    nameToKey[v.name] = v.key;
}
const cache = {};
async function getVar(name) {
  if (cache[name]) return cache[name];
  if (!nameToKey[name]) return null;
  try { cache[name] = await figma.variables.importVariableByKeyAsync(nameToKey[name]); }
  catch { return null; }
  return cache[name];
}
// → Walk figma.currentPage.findAll(...), skip nodes inside INSTANCE parents,
//   and apply role-aware bindings using the token tables above.
```

### Final audit (run before declaring done)

```js
const audit = { fillBound: 0, fillUnbound: 0, strokeBound: 0, strokeUnbound: 0,
                radiusBound: 0, radiusUnbound: 0, padBound: 0, padUnbound: 0,
                gapBound: 0, gapUnbound: 0,
                txFillBound: 0, txFillUnbound: 0,
                sizeBound: 0, sizeUnbound: 0, lhBound: 0, lhUnbound: 0,
                familyBound: 0, familyUnbound: 0, weightBound: 0, weightUnbound: 0 };
// Walk page.findAll(...), skip instances, increment counters per property.
return audit;
// Acceptance: every *Unbound counter is 0
// (documented exceptions: AUTO line-height, Chivo Mono fontFamily).
```

