## Refresh — re-run component key extraction

When the DS file changes, re-run this in `use_figma` against `6Vd1BU48fnhA5F0eg8d57S` and update the tables above:

```js
const results = [];
for (const page of figma.root.children) {
  await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);
  for (const n of page.children) {
    if (n.type === "COMPONENT_SET") {
      results.push({ name: n.name, key: n.key, type: "COMPONENT_SET", page: page.name });
    } else if (n.type === "COMPONENT") {
      results.push({ name: n.name, key: n.key, type: "COMPONENT", page: page.name });
    }
  }
}
results.sort((a, b) => a.page.localeCompare(b.page) || a.name.localeCompare(b.name));
return results;
```

For very large DS files, split into batches by slicing `figma.root.children` (e.g. `slice(0, 36)`, `slice(36, 72)`, etc.) to avoid timeouts.
